description = "High-concurrency game server architecture for Zan: Lock-free Actor concurrency model, Stateful Gateway & Session management with reconnection, Grid-based AOI visual management, Room lifecycle & tick synchronization, Distributed Actor location routing, and Debounced write-back storage queue."
